// "evi_biquads.genexpr": evieve Biquad code for posterity
// Biquads are shit, use TPT instead, @see: "evi_svfs.genexpr"

// @see: "evi_biquads_no_tilde.genexpr" for versions that work with gen no tilde
// Note: never require both evieve '_biquads' files in the same code !!
// @see in Max: [evi.biquadcoeff] & [evi.biquadcoeff~] & [evi.biquad.filter~] for examples of wrappers
// Note: [filtercoeff~] & [filtergraph~] in MSP have the bandpass/resonant types
// incorrectly switched, in evieve these are correct, thus the opposite to MSP.
// Note: there are no evieve approximations here and thus no dependencies,
// I just could not be bothered to work all that out for the sake of Biquads.

//  //  //  Because Gen does not cache require files, the evieve Biquads are
//  //  //  separated out into smaller require files: those required below

// This file:

// Part 1: Coefficients Calculators
// require("evi_biquads_coeffs.genexpr");

// Part 2: Filter Selectors
// require("evi_biquads_selectors.genexpr");

require("evi_biquads_union.genexpr"); // instead of above two

// Part 3: Biquad Filters
require("evi_biquads_filters.genexpr");

// Part 4: Other Stuff
require("evi_biquads_extras.genexpr");

